{
 "annotations": {
  "destructiveHint": false,
  "idempotentHint": true,
  "openWorldHint": false,
  "readOnlyHint": true,
  "title": "Pallet Fitting Calculator"
 },
 "description": "Calculate how many identical boxes fit on a pallet: boxes per layer (trying 90-degree rotation when allowed), layer count within the max height, totals, volume utilisation and weight capping.\n\nBehavior: deterministic geometric packing of one box size in aligned rows and columns \u2014 it does not model interlocked or mixed-orientation patterns; weight_limited reports when max_payload_kg caps the count below the geometric fit; pallet_deck_height_cm defaults to 15. Missing or non-positive dimensions error naming the parameter. Rate-limited (anonymous use: 25 requests/day per IP): a 429 error body carries retry_after_seconds and a Retry-After header \u2014 back off and retry, or call get_subscribe_link for higher limits.\n\nReturns: boxes_per_layer, layers, total_boxes, orientation, boxes_per_row/col, usable_height_cm, utilisation_percent, total_box_volume_cbm, wasted_space_cbm and the weight fields under result, plus confidence, _source and citation (the FreightUtils v1 response envelope).\n\nLimitations: a theoretical best-effort fit \u2014 real stacking obeys carton strength, overhang and load-stability rules it does not model.\n\nRelated: ldm_calculator (pallets into trailer length), vehicle_lookup (pallet capacity per vehicle), container_lookup (pallets into containers).",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "allow_rotation": {
    "description": "Try 90-degree box rotation for the best layer fit. Default: true.",
    "type": "boolean"
   },
   "box_height_cm": {
    "description": "Box height in cm.",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "box_length_cm": {
    "description": "Box length in cm.",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "box_weight_kg": {
    "description": "Weight per box in kg \u2014 enables the weight-capping check.",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "box_width_cm": {
    "description": "Box width in cm.",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "max_payload_kg": {
    "description": "Maximum pallet payload in kg. Example: 1000.",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "pallet_deck_height_cm": {
    "description": "Pallet deck height in cm. Default: 15.",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "pallet_length_cm": {
    "description": "Pallet length in cm. Example: 120 (euro pallet).",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "pallet_max_height_cm": {
    "description": "Maximum stack height in cm INCLUDING the pallet deck. Example: 180.",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "pallet_width_cm": {
    "description": "Pallet width in cm. Example: 80 (euro pallet).",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "pallet_length_cm",
   "pallet_width_cm",
   "pallet_max_height_cm",
   "box_length_cm",
   "box_width_cm",
   "box_height_cm"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
